# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## The Wilderness Bound update had lots of small technical changes which added up - so please report any Bugs you catch on our Discord server.
## We also moved away from crowdin for our translations and now have our own solution. Feel free to contribute: https://explorerseden.eu/translate/
## Thank you!

## Changes:
- Using Crop Dance succesfully now lets it rain the respective Crop (only visual)
- Night Vision now adds the typical night vision goggles effect instead of using Minecrafts effect
- Added Curse of Shortsight (Blurs vision when equipped)
- Added Curse of Color Blindness (Wearer becomes color blind when equipped)
- Added Curse of Mirror Vision (Wearers vision is mirrored horizontally when equipped)
- Added Curse of Void Vision (Wearer sees the world with the eyes of the Void when equipped)
- Added Curse of Spider Vision (Wearer sees the world with the eyes of a Spider when equipped)
- Added Curse of Creeper Vision (Wearer sees the world with the eyes of a Creeper when equipped)
- Added Curse of Ender Vision (Wearer sees the world with the eyes of an Enderman when equipped)
- Added 16 new progression advancements to unlock

## Fixes:
